strategicDirections:
Strategic directions regarding educational activities and personnel provision:
• Creation of a flexible educational-research system "Education-Science-Industry" for training specialists in the metallurgical industry with the aim of integrating the educational process with applied scientific research of the Institute and the needs of enterprises in real-time mode;
• Active international academic integration and adaptation of educational standards to EU requirements for training competitive specialists and restoring the personnel potential of metallurgy in Ukraine.
